OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to father hit by
OL,4,Acar in Fife town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family have paid tribute to a
OL,7,F"much-loved" father who died after
OL,8,Fbeing hit by a car in Fife.
OL,10,FSteven Dick, 48, was pronounced dead at
OL,11,Fthe scene on Lumphinnans Road,
OL,12,FLochgelly, at about 01:30 on Saturday.
OL,13,FThe incident involved a black
OL,14,FVolkswagen Golf.
OL,16,FThe 28-year-old male driver of the car
OL,17,Fwas arrested in connection with a road
OL,18,Ftraffic offence and inquiries are
OL,19,Fongoing, Police Scotland said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
